msgid "Export selected Future configuration"
msgstr "I-export ang napiling configuration ng Future"

#: dist/composer-path/src/Modules/Mcp/Services/ConfigurationService.php:55
#: src/Modules/Mcp/Services/ConfigurationService.php:55
msgid ""
"Export explicit workflow IDs, settings groups and post types using Future "
"backup version/settings/workflows fields. Uses the same non-secret "
"projections as discovery and enforces workflow object permissions. Never "
"exports credentials or raw execution contexts. Omitted scopes are not "
"exported; make separate bounded requests for large sites."
msgstr ""
"I-export ang mga tiyak na workflow ID, mga grupo ng setting at mga post "
"type gamit ang mga field ng Future backup version/settings/workflows. "
"Gumagamit ng parehong hindi lihim na projections tulad ng discovery at "
"nagpapatupad ng mga pahintulot sa workflow object. Huwag kailanman i-export "
"ang mga kredensyal o raw execution contexts. Ang mga naiwang scope ay hindi "
"na-expert; gumawa ng hiwalay na nakabound na mga kahilingan para sa "
"malalaking site."

#: dist/composer-path/src/Modules/Mcp/Services/ConfigurationService.php:65
#: src/Modules/Mcp/Services/ConfigurationService.php:65
msgid "Import workflows as disabled drafts"
msgstr "I-import ang mga workflow bilang mga disabled draft"

#: dist/composer-path/src/Modules/Mcp/Services/ConfigurationService.php:66
#: src/Modules/Mcp/Services/ConfigurationService.php:66
msgid ""
"Import up to 20 workflow records from a Future backup workflows array. "
"Validates every graph, native step field and edition before creating any "
"drafts. Source IDs/statuses are not reused; workflows remain disabled. "
"dry_run validates all records without saving. Settings imports use the "
"individual typed update actions with current revision hashes, not arbitrary "
"option data."
msgstr ""
"I-import ang hanggang 20 workflow records mula sa isang Future backup "
"workflows array. Nagtutukoy ng bawat graph, katutubong field ng hakbang at "
"edisyon bago lumikha ng anumang draft. Ang mga Source ID/statuses ay hindi "
"na muling ginagamit; ang mga workflow ay mananatiling disabled. Ang dry_run "
"ay nagtutukoy ng lahat ng record nang hindi sine-save. Ang mga setting na "
"na-import ay gumagamit ng indibidwal na typed update actions na may "
"kasalukuyang revision hashes, hindi arbitrary option data."

#: dist/composer-path/src/Modules/Mcp/Services/ConfigurationService.php:100
